   - Key Vault Key ID: https://mykeyvault.vault.azure.net/keys/encryption-key/...
   - Wrapped DEK (base64): eyJhbGciOiJSU0EtT0FFUC0yNTYiLCJlbmMiOiJBMjU2R0...

